WEBVTT

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.579
Magacaygu waa Maxamed Xuseen Maxamed.

00:00:02.379 --> 00:00:07.179
Halkan waxaan uga mahadnaqayaa shirkadda A
& A Trade Solution, taasoo iga

00:00:07.179 --> 00:00:10.179
haqaabtirtay agabkii aan uga baahnaa dalka
China

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.919
si aan u furo micraaddan cusub. Adeegyada
ii bixineysey shirkaddu waxa ka mid ah

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:20.039
baadigoobkii ay suuqyada China noogu
baadigoobaysay adeeg wixii dookhayga ahaa

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:24.079
ee aanu dalbanay, taasoo shirkaddu ay
nisiinaysey warbixin joogta ah markasta

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.119
ay nala socosiinaysey halka ay wax
marayaan iyo sida aanu, maaragtay,

00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:33.439
dookhayga waxyaabaha aanu dooranay.
Doorashada ka dib aanu dooranay, waxay noo

00:00:33.439 --> 00:00:37.399
soo heshay agab kwaalitigiisu aad u
sarreeya, taasuu welibana ay noogu soo

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:41.779
heshay qiime rooj jaban oo, maaragtay, na
raali galiyay. Ka dibna markaa aanu

00:00:41.779 --> 00:00:46.879
qiimihii ku iibsannay, shirkaduna ay noo
keentay. Ugu dambeyntii, een, shirkaddu

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:51.219
waxay agabkii noogu keentay si amaan leh
oo da'diina ku dhigan tahay. Shirkaddu waa

00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:55.459
shirkad, maaragtay, aad u wayn. Shirkaddu
waa shirkad China qofka uga keenaysa

00:00:55.459 --> 00:00:59.299
alaab, maaragtay, tayadiisiyo
kwaalitigiisu aad u sarreeya. Shirkadda A

00:00:59.299 --> 00:01:03.299
& A Trade Solution aad baan uga
mahadnaqayaa. Waxaan leeyahay shacabkay

00:01:03.299 --> 00:01:04.579
bulshada, hamo ogaadinan.

00:01:12.879 --> 00:01:13.459
[muusique de générique de fin]
